Advantages of LangChain in project
==================================


| Advantage            | Example in Your Project                                              |
| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Prompt templates     | Reuse shipment report prompts                                        |
| Tool abstraction     | Customer, Weather, Supplier, Risk tools all share a common interface |
| LLM abstraction      | Switch from Groq to OpenAI or Gemini with minimal changes            |
| RAG components       | Retriever, text splitter, embeddings are readily available           |
| Memory               | Store conversation history without custom implementation             |
| Output parsing       | Convert model output into structured formats                         |
| Provider flexibility | Easier to experiment with different LLMs                             |


=========

Disadvantages of LangChain
==========================

| Disadvantage          | Impact                                           |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| Additional dependency | Need to install and track library versions       |
| API changes           | Major releases may require code updates          |
| Learning curve        | Need to learn LangChain concepts                 |
| Hidden complexity     | Framework abstractions can make debugging harder |
| Performance overhead  | Slight overhead compared to minimal custom code  |


=========

Advantages of LangGraph
======================

| Advantage              | Example in Your Project                                                        |
| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| Workflow orchestration | Automatically runs Customer → Retriever → Shipment → Supplier → Weather → Risk |
| State management       | Carries shared data between nodes                                              |
| Conditional routing    | Easy to add branches later                                                     |
| Retry support          | Easier to retry failed steps                                                   |
| Multi-agent workflows  | Supports future expansion to multiple collaborating agents                     |
| Cleaner architecture   | Each step is isolated as a node                                                |


===========

Disadvantages of LangGraph
==========================

| Disadvantage             | Impact                                |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------- |
| More concepts to learn   | Graphs, nodes, edges, state           |
| Overkill for simple apps | Not necessary for very small chatbots |
| Dependency on framework  | Must follow LangGraph patterns        |
| Graph design effort      | Need to model workflows explicitly    |


=============

Advantages of Custom Python
===========================

| Advantage                  | Example                                         |
| -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| Full control               | Every function behaves exactly as you design it |
| Fewer dependencies         | Only Python and the APIs you choose             |
| Easier debugging           | Straightforward function calls                  |
| Better for tiny projects   | Minimal setup                                   |
| Potentially lower overhead | No framework abstraction layer                  |


===============

Disadvantages of Custom Python
==============================

| Disadvantage          | Example                                                |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| More code             | Must implement prompts, routing, memory, retries, etc. |
| Harder maintenance    | Workflow logic becomes scattered                       |
| Poor scalability      | Adding new tools often requires changes in many places |
| Manual state handling | Pass data between functions yourself                   |
| Repeated code         | Similar patterns need to be rewritten                  |


