Which is better for this project?

| Project Size                         | Recommended Approach              |
| ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------- |
| Simple FAQ chatbot                   | Custom Python                     |
| Single LLM call                      | Custom Python                     |
| Basic RAG chatbot                    | LangChain                         |
| **AI Supply Chain Intelligence BOT** | **LangChain + LangGraph** ✅       |
| Multi-agent system                   | LangGraph                         |
| Enterprise AI application            | LangChain + LangGraph + LangSmith |


===============

Recommendation

For your project, LangChain + LangGraph provides the biggest advantage because this chatbot is a multi-step workflow rather than a single LLM call.
It involves customer lookup, document retrieval, multiple tools (shipment, supplier, weather, risk), shared state, and final report generation. 
These are exactly the kinds of problems LangChain and LangGraph are designed to solve, making the code easier to extend 
and maintain than a large custom Python implementation.

